# Tesseli visual fidelity

Before UI work, read `docs/02-visual-spec.md`.

Non-negotiable:
- warm bone background, sage primary, elegant low-noise surfaces;
- Inter UI, Playfair Display serif/italic headings, JetBrains Mono for time/codes;
- rounded-3xl cards, subtle borders/shadows;
- 256px desktop sidebar; mobile top bar + bottom navigation;
- microanimations ~200–300ms, subtle only;
- dark mode must feel intentionally designed, not inverted by accident;
- do not default to generic shadcn/blue SaaS aesthetics;
- keep few-click guided workflows.

Componente canônico obrigatório (`docs/02-visual-spec.md` §Biblioteca de Componentes Canônica): `PageContainer`, `PageHeader`, `SectionHeader`, `Modal`, `Drawer`, `EmptyState`, `LoadingState`, `SearchField`, `ConfirmDialog`, `StatusBadge`, `Button`. Nenhuma tela reimplementa modal, drawer, estado vazio, estado de carregamento, busca ou confirmação com Tailwind solto — nem quando o resultado visual parece idêntico. Extensão de comportamento é prop nova no primitivo, nunca cópia local.

Official brand asset:
- `public/brand/source/virginia-psi-lockup-original.png` is the immutable source lockup (byte-identical to the file sent).
- `public/brand/virginia-psi-lockup-transparent.png` is the display asset: same artwork with only the edge-connected off-white matte converted to alpha.
- Do not overlay `BrandWordmark` or any other brand text on top of the PNG.
- Never redraw, reinterpret, vectorize, crop, recolor the foreground, or use mix-blend-mode / cream plates.
- Resize only the display container and preserve aspect ratio with `object-fit: contain`.
